IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sda-common`
IMPORT `fhog-terms`
IMPORT `taa-procedure`
IMPORT `sda-home`
IMPORT `sda-vehicles`

-- Stamp Duties Act 1923 (SA) and Stamp Duties Regulations 2013 -- cases for the motor vehicle core (sda-vehicles.l4).
--
-- Every expected value was worked by hand from the deposited texts (the Act as at 2025-02-13, the Regulations as at
-- 2022-09-29), with the Schedule 2 clause 2(1) tables also done in an independent calculator written from the statutory
-- words (scratchpad au-sa-1/hand.py), never copied from this encoding's output. The s 42BA and s 71CB cases and the
-- s 42B(1a), (2) rule were added in the fix of 24 October 2026, worked by hand from the same texts. Regulative rules are
-- asserted with EVALTRACE where the trace ends FULFILLED, and #TRACEd with an "-- expect:" line where it ends in a
-- breach. Clock: days from making the application.
--
-- Based on content from the South Australian Legislation website (CC BY 4.0). Not the official text. See NOTES.md.

§ `Cases -- the person registering a motor vehicle`

§§ `s 42B(1) -- the value of a motor vehicle`

-- A new car listed at $38 000 with $2 000 of listed optional equipment: $40 000.
#ASSERT `the value of the motor vehicle (s 42B(1))` `registering a new motor vehicle that has a list price` 38000 2000 0 0 EQUALS 40000
-- A second-hand car bought for $15 000, worth $17 000: the higher, $17 000; bought for $18 000: $18 000.
#ASSERT `the value of the motor vehicle (s 42B(1))` `transferring the registration of a second-hand motor vehicle on its sale` 0 0 15000 17000 EQUALS 17000
#ASSERT `the value of the motor vehicle (s 42B(1))` `transferring the registration of a second-hand motor vehicle on its sale` 0 0 18000 17000 EQUALS 18000
#ASSERT `the value of the motor vehicle (s 42B(1))` `any other application` 0 0 0 20000 EQUALS 20000

§§ `Schedule 2 clause 2(1) -- the registration component`

-- Not a commercial vehicle or trailer (clause 2(1)(a)); $350 gives $4, raised to the $5 minimum (clause 2(1)(c)).
#ASSERT `the registration component before exemptions (clause 2(1))` 350 FALSE EQUALS 5
#ASSERT `the registration component before exemptions (clause 2(1))` 800 FALSE EQUALS 8
#ASSERT `the registration component before exemptions (clause 2(1))` 1000 FALSE EQUALS 10
#ASSERT `the registration component before exemptions (clause 2(1))` 1500 FALSE EQUALS 20
#ASSERT `the registration component before exemptions (clause 2(1))` 2500 FALSE EQUALS 45
#ASSERT `the registration component before exemptions (clause 2(1))` 3000 FALSE EQUALS 60
#ASSERT `the registration component before exemptions (clause 2(1))` 17000 FALSE EQUALS 620
#ASSERT `the registration component before exemptions (clause 2(1))` 25000 FALSE EQUALS 940
#ASSERT `the registration component before exemptions (clause 2(1))` 30050 FALSE EQUALS 1144
#ASSERT `the registration component before exemptions (clause 2(1))` 40000 FALSE EQUALS 1540
#ASSERT `the registration component before exemptions (clause 2(1))` 45000 FALSE EQUALS 1740
-- A commercial vehicle or a trailer (clause 2(1)(b)): $3 per $100 above $2 000, with no fourth band.
#ASSERT `the registration component before exemptions (clause 2(1))` 1500 TRUE EQUALS 20
#ASSERT `the registration component before exemptions (clause 2(1))` 12000 TRUE EQUALS 330
#ASSERT `the registration component before exemptions (clause 2(1))` 25000 TRUE EQUALS 720
#ASSERT `the registration component before exemptions (clause 2(1))` 45000 TRUE EQUALS 1320

§§ `Schedule 2 clause 2(2) -- exemptions 4, 6 and 11`

-- The facts most cases share: no exemption applies. Parameters: trailer, ad valorem duty paid, s 38 entitlement,
-- already enjoyed for another vehicle, owner, State concession card, Commonwealth pensioner card, reduced fares.
GIVEN `trailer` IS A BOOLEAN
      `ad valorem` IS A NUMBER
      `s 38` IS A BOOLEAN
      `another` IS A BOOLEAN
      `owner` IS A BOOLEAN
      `state card` IS A BOOLEAN
      `pension card` IS A BOOLEAN
      `fares` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Vehicle exemption facts`
`exemption facts` MEANS
    `Vehicle exemption facts` WITH
        `it is a trailer that is not a heavy vehicle`                                       IS `trailer`
        `ad valorem duty paid or payable on another instrument transferring the vehicle`    IS `ad valorem`
        `the applicant is entitled under MVA s 38 to a reduced registration fee`           IS `s 38`
        `the applicant enjoys exemption 11 or policy exemption 6 for another vehicle owned` IS `another`
        `the applicant owns the vehicle`                                                    IS `owner`
        `the applicant holds a State concession card of the prescribed class`              IS `state card`
        `the applicant holds a Commonwealth pensioner entitlement card`                    IS `pension card`
        `the card entitles the applicant to reduced public transport fares in the State`   IS `fares`

`no exemption` MEANS `exemption facts` FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE

#ASSERT `the registration component (clause 2(1), (2))` 25000 FALSE `no exemption` EQUALS 940
-- Exemption 4: a trailer that is not a heavy vehicle.
#ASSERT `the registration component (clause 2(1), (2))` 8000 TRUE (`exemption facts` TRUE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 0
-- Exemption 11: entitled to the s 38 reduced fee, not already enjoyed for another vehicle.
#ASSERT `the registration component (clause 2(1), (2))` 25000 FALSE (`exemption facts` FALSE 0 TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the registration component (clause 2(1), (2))` 25000 FALSE (`exemption facts` FALSE 0 TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 940
-- Exemption 6: $300 of ad valorem duty already paid reduces $940 to $640; $1 000 paid covers it all.
#ASSERT `the registration component (clause 2(1), (2))` 25000 FALSE (`exemption facts` FALSE 300 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 640
#ASSERT `the registration component (clause 2(1), (2))` 25000 FALSE (`exemption facts` FALSE 1000 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS 0

§§ `Schedule 2 clause 2(3), (4) -- the policy of insurance component`

#ASSERT `the policy of insurance component before exemptions (clause 2(3))` `not more than 31 days` EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 5
#ASSERT `the policy of insurance component before exemptions (clause 2(3))` (`more than 31 days but less than 12 months` 3) EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 15
#ASSERT `the policy of insurance component before exemptions (clause 2(3))` (`more than 31 days but less than 12 months` 6) EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 30
-- 7 months is two 3-month periods and part of a third: $45.
#ASSERT `the policy of insurance component before exemptions (clause 2(3))` (`more than 31 days but less than 12 months` 7) EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 45
#ASSERT `the policy of insurance component before exemptions (clause 2(3))` (`more than 31 days but less than 12 months` 9) EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 45
#ASSERT `the policy of insurance component before exemptions (clause 2(3))` `12 months` EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 60
#ASSERT `the policy of insurance component before exemptions (clause 2(3))` `more than 12 months` EQUALS `not covered` `a registration period longer than 12 months is not in the Schedule 2 clause 2(3) table`
-- Exemptions 2, 6 and 8.
#ASSERT NOT (`the policy of insurance component is exempt (clause 2(4), exemptions 2, 6 and 8)` `no exemption`)
#ASSERT `the policy of insurance component is exempt (clause 2(4), exemptions 2, 6 and 8)` (`exemption facts` TRUE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT `the policy of insurance component is exempt (clause 2(4), exemptions 2, 6 and 8)` (`exemption facts` FALSE 0 TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the policy of insurance component is exempt (clause 2(4), exemptions 2, 6 and 8)` (`exemption facts` FALSE 0 TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE))
-- Exemption 8 with a State concession card of the reg 14 class, or a Commonwealth pensioner entitlement card.
#ASSERT `the policy of insurance component is exempt (clause 2(4), exemptions 2, 6 and 8)` (`exemption facts` FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT `the policy of insurance component is exempt (clause 2(4), exemptions 2, 6 and 8)` (`exemption facts` FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the policy of insurance component is exempt (clause 2(4), exemptions 2, 6 and 8)` (`exemption facts` FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`the policy of insurance component is exempt (clause 2(4), exemptions 2, 6 and 8)` (`exemption facts` FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE))
-- Exemption 8 frees the policy component only; the registration component is still payable.
#ASSERT `the registration component (clause 2(1), (2))` 25000 FALSE (`exemption facts` FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS 940

§§ `s 42B(1d) -- the duty on the application`

-- Registering a new $40 000 car for 12 months: $1 540 plus $60.
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (s 42B(1d))` TRUE 40000 FALSE `12 months` `no exemption` EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 1600
-- Transferring a second-hand car valued at $17 000: the registration component only, $620.
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (s 42B(1d))` FALSE 17000 FALSE `12 months` `no exemption` EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 620
-- Registering for 6 months with a concession card: the policy component is exempt, $940.
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (s 42B(1d))` TRUE 25000 FALSE (`more than 31 days but less than 12 months` 6) (`exemption facts` FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 940
-- Registering for 6 months, no exemption: $940 plus $30.
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (s 42B(1d))` TRUE 25000 FALSE (`more than 31 days but less than 12 months` 6) `no exemption` EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 970
-- Entitled to the s 38 reduced fee: both components exempt.
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (s 42B(1d))` TRUE 25000 FALSE `12 months` (`exemption facts` FALSE 0 TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
-- A trailer that is not a heavy vehicle: nothing.
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (s 42B(1d))` TRUE 8000 TRUE `12 months` (`exemption facts` TRUE 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
-- A registration for more than 12 months is not in the table.
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (s 42B(1d))` TRUE 25000 FALSE `more than 12 months` `no exemption` EQUALS `not covered` `a registration period longer than 12 months is not in the Schedule 2 clause 2(3) table`

§§ `s 42BA -- a transfer of registration where a registered owner continues`

-- A $17 000 car, its registration transferred with one registered owner staying on (a co-owner added or removed): the
-- s 42BA formula is missing, so not covered. Apart from s 42BA the registration component would be $620.
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (ss 42B(1d), 42BA)` FALSE TRUE 17000 FALSE `12 months` `no exemption` EQUALS `not covered` `the s 42BA formula for a transfer of registration to or from a continuing owner is missing from the deposited text`
-- No owner continues: s 42B(1d)(b), $620.
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (ss 42B(1d), 42BA)` FALSE FALSE 17000 FALSE `12 months` `no exemption` EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 620
-- s 42BA is about transfers only: registering (or renewing) for 12 months is $620 plus $60.
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (ss 42B(1d), 42BA)` TRUE TRUE 17000 FALSE `12 months` `no exemption` EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 680
-- s 42BA(2): an exemption that leaves nothing stays whole -- exemption 11 (the s 38 reduced fee), or exemption 6 with
-- $1 000 of ad valorem duty already paid against $620.
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (ss 42B(1d), 42BA)` FALSE TRUE 17000 FALSE `12 months` (`exemption facts` FALSE 0 TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (ss 42B(1d), 42BA)` FALSE TRUE 17000 FALSE `12 months` (`exemption facts` FALSE 1000 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
-- Exemption 6 with $300 paid leaves $320 as the duty apart from s 42BA: not covered.
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (ss 42B(1d), 42BA)` FALSE TRUE 17000 FALSE `12 months` (`exemption facts` FALSE 300 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS `not covered` `the s 42BA formula for a transfer of registration to or from a continuing owner is missing from the deposited text`

§§ `s 71CB(2)(a)(ii), (b), (3) with ss 42B and 42BA -- the duty on a vehicle application`

-- Adding my spouse as a co-owner of my $17 000 car (I stay on): exempt under s 71CB, which s 42BA(2) keeps whole.
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (ss 42B, 42BA, 71CB)` TRUE `spouses or domestic partners` FALSE FALSE TRUE 17000 FALSE `12 months` `no exemption` EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
-- Transferred to me from a former spouse: exempt if the Commissioner is satisfied it results from the irretrievable
-- breakdown (s 71CB(3)); otherwise $620.
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (ss 42B, 42BA, 71CB)` TRUE `former spouses or former domestic partners` TRUE FALSE FALSE 17000 FALSE `12 months` `no exemption` EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (ss 42B, 42BA, 71CB)` TRUE `former spouses or former domestic partners` FALSE FALSE FALSE 17000 FALSE `12 months` `no exemption` EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 620
-- From someone who is not a partner: $620.
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (ss 42B, 42BA, 71CB)` TRUE `neither` FALSE FALSE FALSE 17000 FALSE `12 months` `no exemption` EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 620
-- Registering for 6 months, in my name, a $25 000 car whose last registered owner was my domestic partner
-- (s 71CB(2)(b)): exempt, where otherwise it is $940 plus $30.
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (ss 42B, 42BA, 71CB)` TRUE `spouses or domestic partners` FALSE TRUE FALSE 25000 FALSE (`more than 31 days but less than 12 months` 6) `no exemption` EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 0
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (ss 42B, 42BA, 71CB)` FALSE `spouses or domestic partners` FALSE TRUE FALSE 25000 FALSE (`more than 31 days but less than 12 months` 6) `no exemption` EQUALS `the amount, in dollars, is` 970
-- Not the sole effect (a partner and a stranger together, say), with a continuing owner: s 42BA, not covered.
#ASSERT `the duty on the vehicle application (ss 42B, 42BA, 71CB)` FALSE `spouses or domestic partners` FALSE FALSE TRUE 17000 FALSE `12 months` `no exemption` EQUALS `not covered` `the s 42BA formula for a transfer of registration to or from a continuing owner is missing from the deposited text`

§§ `s 42B(1a), (2) -- state the value and pay the duty when applying`

-- State the value and pay the duty to the Registrar on making the application (day 0): fulfilled.
#ASSERT EVALTRACE (`s 42B(1a), (2) -- state the value and pay the duty to the Registrar when applying` TRUE) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the applicant for registration or transfer of registration of a motor vehicle` `state the value of the motor vehicle in the application` 0), (EVENT `the applicant for registration or transfer of registration of a motor vehicle` `pay the duty to the Registrar of Motor Vehicles` 0)) EQUALS FULFILLED
-- No duty payable (exempt): only the value is to be stated.
#ASSERT EVALTRACE (`s 42B(1a), (2) -- state the value and pay the duty to the Registrar when applying` FALSE) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the applicant for registration or transfer of registration of a motor vehicle` `state the value of the motor vehicle in the application` 0)) EQUALS FULFILLED
-- expect: BREACH BY the applicant for registration or transfer of registration of a motor vehicle, "s 42B(2): the duty must be paid to the Registrar ... at the time of making the application ..." (value stated, payment a day later)
#TRACE `s 42B(1a), (2) -- state the value and pay the duty to the Registrar when applying` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the applicant for registration or transfer of registration of a motor vehicle` DOES `state the value of the motor vehicle in the application` AT 0
    PARTY `the applicant for registration or transfer of registration of a motor vehicle` DOES `pay the duty to the Registrar of Motor Vehicles` AT 1
